        <briefdescription>
<para>Dispatches one constraint row&apos;s predicate against its scan scope. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Looks <computeroutput>predicateName</computeroutput> up in the closed predicate vocabulary (SPEC §7). Scope-scoped predicates (perColumnPredicates) are invoked once, scanning tables themselves; row-scoped predicates are invoked once per row of <computeroutput>tableName</computeroutput>, skipped entirely when <computeroutput>tableName</computeroutput> does not declare <computeroutput>columnName</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>predicateName</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The predicate&apos;s identifier string. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>predicateArgs</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The predicate&apos;s arguments (everything after the name). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>columnName</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The constrained column name. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>root</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The relation document to scan (row-scoped predicates). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>tableName</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The relation (table) name to scan (row-scoped predicates). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>roots</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Every parsed relation for this output (scope-scoped predicates). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>dir</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The manifest&apos;s parent directory. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>manifestDoc</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The parsed manifest. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>sourceFile</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The failing file&apos;s path, for error locations. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
